Files under languages/ come from Helix (https://github.com/helix-editor/helix)
as packaged by nixpkgs:

- languages/*/highlights.scm and languages/*/injections.scm are copied
  unmodified from Helix's runtime/queries and are licensed under the Mozilla
  Public License 2.0: https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
- languages/languages.json is derived from Helix's languages.toml (MPL-2.0).
- languages/*/grammar.wasm are built from the tree-sitter grammars Helix pins:
  tree-sitter-nix (https://github.com/nix-community/tree-sitter-nix) and
  tree-sitter-bash (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-bash), both MIT.

SOURCES records the Helix version and grammar revisions.
